.TH PENDULUM 2
.SH NAME
pendulum \- reusable pendulum torque and diagnostic kernel
.SH DESCRIPTION
Computes nonlinear gravitational torque with optional linear damping, Coulomb
friction, constant load, wind, and periodic drive. It also supplies mechanical
energy and the small-angle period.
